		<br><br>

		<<link [["알"을 품어준다|Bird Tower Stone Warm]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 5>><<transform bird 1>><<bird_stockholm 1>><</link>><<gbirdstockholm>><<gdom>><<gglove>>
